# Reuse native CuTe signatures for SM90 DSA backward with topk_length.
# Read the physical top-k width from the runtime tensor in both warpgroups,
# preserving the upper/lower length clamps when sharing compiled kernels.
# The no-length path retains its max_topk specialization. SM100 kernels have
# width-dependent tuning and are intentionally outside this SM90 patch.

